Note on the data this software collects.

jobradar reads publicly available job postings from Hacker News, We Work
Remotely and Remote OK. This licence covers the software only, not the data.

Remote OK's API terms require that anything built on their data link back to
the posting on Remote OK with a followed link and credit Remote OK as the
source. The dashboard does both. If you reuse this project, keep that in place.
